OL,3,GNEWSACouple want to move house over
OL,4,Arodent invasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FA couple have described feeling like
OL,7,Fthey are "living on eggshells" after
OL,8,Ftheir garden became "overrun" by
OL,9,Frodents.
OL,11,FCarol and Rod Williams, both in their
OL,12,F60s, moved into a property managed by
OL,13,FOcean Housing in Roche, Cornwall, in
OL,14,FApril - and claim they have faced a
OL,15,F"constant battle" with rats and mice in
OL,16,Fthe back garden.
OL,18,FOcean Housing, a housing association,
OL,19,Fsaid it had so far failed to determine
OL,20,Fthe source of the rodents - but that a
OL,21,Fpest control inspection had been
OL,22,Frequested.
OL,23,APub: 19-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
