OL,3,GNEWSACouple want to move house over
OL,4,Arodent invasion
OL,5,
OL,6,FNiall Gallagher from the British Pest
OL,7,FControl Association said they were
OL,8,Fhearing an "anecodotal" increase in
OL,9,Freports of rodents - while these
OL,10,Freports had also shifted from being
OL,11,Fseasonal to year-round."
